, NULL, NULL, 'en', 'native_title_verified', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, '19', '3', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '10.1080/17483107.2022.2111723', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://doi.org/10.1080/17483107.2022.2111723', '2026-09-02', NULL, NULL, 2, 'sr_meta', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'COMPLETE', 'VERIFIED', 'RESOLVED', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'NOT AN INDEPENDENT LINE FROM REF-00971 OR REF-00784. Established from this source''s own logged Crossref record (1cfd192efd557b21.json, 117 references): keys e_1_3_3_43_1 through e_1_3_3_90_1 are exactly 48 entries in strict first-author alphabetical order, bounded below by the methods citations (40 PRISMA/Moher, 41 US DoJ, 42 Hong/MMAT) and above by key 91 where the ordering restarts. That block is the review''s included-studies list. Inside it: key 56 = 10.3109/17483107.2010.509885 = REF-00971 (Dutta part I), and key 71 = 10.1016/j.apmr.2010.01.009 = REF-00784 (Koontz), the batch''s own declared anchor. Counting this review as convergent with either is double-counting one line of evidence. The agonist brief 9.1 said ''admit it as context and convergence, not as an anchor''; the convergence half of that is withdrawn. SCOPE IS EXACTLY TWO: 10.3109/17483107.2010.549898 (REF-00972, part II) appears nowhere in the 117 references, and REF-00974 (Arnet 2025) post-dates the review, so both remain genuinely independent of it. The DOIs were already in this batch''s own citation_mining row for ACG-08 from 21:11; the list was stored and never read back.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02 21:08', 'session_2026-09-02-research-batch-05-circulation-icf', '2026-09-02 22:03', 'session_2026-09-02-research-batch-05-circulation-icf', 'crossref', NULL, 1, NULL, '604-622', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CORRECTED', '2026-09-02 verification_note CORRECTED (nothing in the batch recorded that this systematic review contains two of its co-admitted primaries, while the brief instructed a reader to count it as convergence). Replaced text was: None || 2026-09-02 verification_disposition CORRECTED (insert_source wrote every VERIFIED row with no CLOSED disposition, which D-0157 invariant I1 forbids; the default is fixed for new rows and these nine predate the fix). Replaced text was: None', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'pending', 'mined', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CLOSED', 'tool', NULL);
